@startuml Trade Store Architecture Diagram

title Trade Store Service - System Architecture

package "Client Layer" {
    [REST Client] as Client
    [Kafka Producer] as KafkaProducer
}

package "API Layer" {
    [TradeController] as Controller
    [TradeControllerOptimized] as ControllerOpt
    [GlobalExceptionHandler] as ExceptionHandler
}

package "Business Logic Layer" {
    [TradeService] as Service
    [TradeServiceOptimized] as ServiceOpt
    [KafkaTradeConsumer] as Consumer
}

package "Data Access Layer" {
    [TradeRepository] as TradeRepo
    [AuditMessageRepository] as AuditRepo
}

package "Database Layer" {
    database "PostgreSQL" as PG
    database "MongoDB" as Mongo
}

package "Infrastructure" {
    [Kafka Cluster] as Kafka
    [Spring Boot] as SpringBoot
    [Actuator] as Actuator
}

package "Monitoring" {
    [Prometheus] as Prometheus
    [Micrometer] as Micrometer
}

' Connections
Client --> Controller : HTTP/REST
Client --> ControllerOpt : HTTP/REST
Controller --> Service : DI
ControllerOpt --> ServiceOpt : DI
Controller --> ExceptionHandler : Exception Handling
ControllerOpt --> ExceptionHandler : Exception Handling

KafkaProducer --> Kafka : Send Messages
Kafka --> Consumer : Consume Messages
Consumer --> Service : Process Trades

Service --> TradeRepo : JPA Operations
ServiceOpt --> TradeRepo : JPA Operations
Consumer --> AuditRepo : MongoDB Operations

TradeRepo --> PG : CRUD Operations
AuditRepo --> Mongo : Document Operations

SpringBoot --> Controller : Component Scan
SpringBoot --> Service : Component Scan
SpringBoot --> ServiceOpt : Component Scan
SpringBoot --> Consumer : Component Scan
SpringBoot --> ExceptionHandler : Component Scan

Service --> Micrometer : Metrics Collection
ServiceOpt --> Micrometer : Metrics Collection
Micrometer --> Prometheus : Export Metrics
Actuator --> Prometheus : Metrics Endpoint

' Notes
note right of Client : REST API Consumers\nExternal Systems\nTesting Tools
note right of Controller : Basic CRUD\nSingle Trade\n/api/trades/*
note right of ControllerOpt : Advanced Features\nBulk Operations\n/api/v2/trades/*
note right of Service : Core Logic\nVersion Management\nScheduled Expiry
note right of ServiceOpt : Performance\nBulk Processing\nAsync Operations
note right of PG : Primary Trade Data\nACID Transactions\nOptimistic Locking
note right of Mongo : Audit Trail\nMessage History\nError Tracking
note right of SpringBoot : Auto-Configuration\nDependency Injection\nEmbedded Tomcat

@enduml
